OL,3,ASouth Korea catches 111 students with  
OL,4,Anew measures against exam cheating     
OL,6,FSouth Korea's education ministry says  
OL,7,F111 candidates were found with         
OL,8,Funauthorised smart devices during a    
OL,9,Fhigh-stakes nationwide exam, after     
OL,10,Fofficials introduced urgent measures to
OL,11,Ftackle rising cases of AI-assisted     
OL,12,Fcheating.                              
OL,14,FFive of the candidates were caught     
OL,15,Fred-handed using smart devices during  
OL,16,Fthe exam, authorities said on Friday.  
OL,18,FHalf a million students sat for the    
OL,19,Fcollege entry exam, also known as      
OL,20,FSuneung, which took place this week    
OL,21,Funder the shadow of several recent     
OL,22,Fhigh-profile cheating scandals.        
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
