OL,3,ASouth Korea catches 111 students with  
OL,4,Anew measures against exam cheating     
OL,6,FPrior to the Suneung, authorities      
OL,7,Fannounced anti-cheating measures such  
OL,8,Fas emergency alerts sent to every      
OL,9,Fsingle mobile phone in the country to  
OL,10,Fdetect unauthorised devices in exam    
OL,11,Fhalls.                                 
